{"id":"o-cohassetsailingclub-org","claimKey":"157219ab8cbeea5b95c8fbd87870384c1c1030bb276d67f7b26fe8ca18add362","title":"Cohasset Sailing Club Founders' Hall","cat":"water","art":"sailing","area":"Boston, MA","metroId":"boston","src":"cohassetsailingclub.org","specs":[],"options":[{"name":"Jr. Lessons","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Open Sail","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Yoga on Saturdays","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Kevin O'Connor - Kayak Berths","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Joyce Pofs-Driscoll - Hall Rental","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Kayak and Paddle Board Racks","detail":"","price":null}],"services":[{"name":"Jr. Lessons","desc":"The CSC Junior Program is designed to introduce young sailors to the fundamentals of sailing and encourage a lifelong love for knowledge of and confidence in the wind and sea. Instructors - high schoolers and college students from Cohasset - teach the essential skills of rigging, safety, boat handling, and sail trim","photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/68fd5e1cef6da50759cc53b0/021e9b48-25b9-404e-bece-0a2613ebc9be/Screenshot+2025-11-14+at+12.10.52%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":0}]},{"name":"Open Sail","desc":"The CSC’s fleet of boats is available for members to take out on the water on their own or with friends or family. Instructors and staff are on hand to help rig the boat before heading out on the water and to assist in unrigging once you’re done. The trained staff is also ready to assist you with a Boston Whaler should the wind or tide take unexpected turns. All members must complete the helmsman test prior to taking a boat out. Life jacket and closed toe shoes required. Our Marshall Sandpiper will also be available for Free Sailing beginning Saturday, July 25. In addition to passing our helmsman’s test, potential sailors must complete a short on-the-water evaluation. Depending on demand,","photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/68fd5e1cef6da50759cc53b0/046e78d6-2797-4dbd-b6cb-14c97d3dee11/dji_fly_20250728_133134_0255_1753729500264_photo.JPG?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":1}]},{"name":"Yoga on Saturdays","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/68fd5e1cef6da50759cc53b0/045282e1-9648-4058-9762-b46f51278087/Yoga+1.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":2}]},{"name":"Kevin O'Connor - Kayak Berths","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/68fd5e1cef6da50759cc53b0/37cd9e38-03a1-4227-b088-ff4c84090600/Screenshot+2025-11-14+at+6.06.23%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":3}]},{"name":"Joyce Pofs-Driscoll - Hall Rental","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/68fd5e1cef6da50759cc53b0/37cd9e38-03a1-4227-b088-ff4c84090600/Screenshot+2025-11-14+at+6.06.23%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":4}]},{"name":"Kayak and Paddle Board Racks","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/68fd5e1cef6da50759cc53b0/2b68e3de-3259-4989-8587-002a0b6b1ae6/Screenshot+2025-11-14+at+12.25.36%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":5}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"We are a non-profit community sailing club that has served as a rite of passage for Cohasset youth since 1960. Our primary mission is to teach juniors how to sail while fostering independence, confidence, and an appreciation for the wind and ocean.","cover":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/68fd5e1cef6da50759cc53b0/905db90e-3030-4fee-aecb-a79a1d0f9d4c/IMG_0005.jpg?format=2500w","photos":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/68fd5e1cef6da50759cc53b0/905db90e-3030-4fee-aecb-a79a1d0f9d4c/IMG_0005.jpg?format=2500w","https://